@startuml
!theme cerulean-outline
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Cilicon run cycle - GitHub Actions provisioner

actor "CI Platform Operator" as Op
participant "Cilicon App" as App
participant "VMManager" as VMM
participant "VMConfigHelper" as Helper
participant "LeaseParser" as Lease
participant "SSH Client" as SSH
participant "GithubActionsProvisioner" as Prov
participant "GitHub API" as GH
participant "Ephemeral Guest VM" as VM

Op -> App: Launch Cilicon.app
activate App
App -> App: ConfigManager decodes cilicon.yml
App -> VMM: setupAndRunVM
activate VMM

VMM -> VMM: cloneBundle - delete previous clone, copy master bundle
VMM -> Helper: computeRunConfiguration with hardware, mounts, console devices
Helper --> VMM: VZVirtualMachineConfiguration
VMM -> VM: start
activate VM
VMM -> App: vmState = running, framebuffer view appears
App -> VMM: start(vm) from VirtualMachineView onAppear
note right of VMM: runCounter is incremented here,\nnot inside the run cycle
VMM -> Lease: leaseForMacAddress, up to 5 attempts 5s apart
Lease --> VMM: guest IP address

VMM -> SSH: connect with configured credentials, retry up to sshConnectMaxRetries
activate SSH
SSH -> VM: echo ssh-connected
VM --> SSH: ssh-connected
SSH --> VMM: connected client

opt preRun configured
  VMM -> SSH: executeCommandStream preRun
  SSH -> VM: run shell command
  VM --> SSH: stdout / stderr
  SSH --> VMM: streamed output to SSHLogger
end

opt livenessProbe configured
  VMM -> VMM: start liveness probe task after delay
end

VMM -> Prov: provision with bundle and SSH client
activate Prov
Prov -> GH: JWT-signed request for installation
GH --> Prov: installation id
Prov -> GH: POST installation access_tokens
GH --> Prov: installation token
Prov -> GH: POST actions/runners/registration-token
GH --> Prov: runner registration token
opt downloadLatest is true
  Prov -> GH: GET actions/runners/downloads
  GH --> Prov: osx / arm64 download URL
end
Prov -> SSH: curl runner, config.sh --ephemeral, run.sh
SSH -> VM: run shell command
VM -> GH: register ephemeral runner and execute job
GH --> VM: workflow job
VM --> SSH: job log on stdout
SSH --> Prov: streamed output to SSHLogger
Prov --> VMM: returns when run.sh exits
note right of VMM: provisioner errors are caught and logged,\nthe cycle continues to postRun
deactivate Prov

opt postRun configured
  VMM -> SSH: executeCommandStream postRun
  SSH -> VM: run shell command
end

VMM -> SSH: close
deactivate SSH
VMM -> VMM: cancel liveness probe task
VMM -> VM: stop
deactivate VM
VMM -> VMM: handleStop
alt runCounter reached numberOfRunsUntilHostReboot
  VMM -> App: restart Apple Event, then terminate
else otherwise
  VMM -> VMM: setupAndRunVirtualMachine - next cycle
end
deactivate VMM
deactivate App
@enduml
